      "data": {
        "block_title": null,
        "block_description": "&nbsp;\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 125%;\"><img class=\"aligncenter\" style=\"height: 40%; width: 40%; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\" src=\"/uploads/2021/11/sphere-tt5-logo-min.png\" alt=\"sphereit tech talks\" /></h3>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In the November edition of our Tech Talks series, we’ll host experts from Grand Parade and VirtusLab. The first topic will be all about the runtime safety of </span><b>#Akka</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> &amp; the serialization toolbox for Akka messages. The latter will focus on optimizing lead time for your changes via </span><b>Trust Driven Development</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. </span></p></br>",
